\@writefile{lof}{\defcounter {refsection}{0}\relax }\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.18}{\ignorespaces The pre- and post-fit distributions of the background estimation model in the sideband region of the Higgs boson candidate mass spectrum for the 2018 data taking era of the CMS detector. The distribution observed for data is also shown and, in the lower panel, the ratio of the pre-fit and post-fit distributions with respect to data can be seen. A reasonable agreement to data is observed already for the pre-fit distribution, indicating that the model is able to describe the data well within the statistical fluctuations observed in data.\relax }}{79}{figure.caption.63}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:PrePostFit}{{4.18}{79}{The pre- and post-fit distributions of the background estimation model in the sideband region of the Higgs boson candidate mass spectrum for the 2018 data taking era of the CMS detector. The distribution observed for data is also shown and, in the lower panel, the ratio of the pre-fit and post-fit distributions with respect to data can be seen. A reasonable agreement to data is observed already for the pre-fit distribution, indicating that the model is able to describe the data well within the statistical fluctuations observed in data.\relax }{figure.caption.63}{}}
